+ * destinations and the row bands of the wide surface it mirrors into, so each
+ * of those is saved the first time it is written and restored in reverse
+ * order at the end (an overlap is then restored from the earliest save, taken
+ * before any write). PSX_REPLAY_COW=0 keeps the whole-surface copies;
