+/* render_thread.c - redraws on host render threads (Time to Kill D17AW).
+ * See render_thread.h. The emulation thread owns the guest, its renderer
+ * instance and the window; each render thread owns another renderer instance
+ * (render_copy/, rc_* and rc2_*) on a GL context shared with the first.
+ * Everything the threads exchange goes through s_mu: snapshot reference
+ * counts, the request queue, finished images and the fences that order GPU
+ * access to shared textures. */
